\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. MY soul, through my Redeemer's care,
\par Saved from the second death I feel;
\par My eyes from tears of dark despair,
\par My feet from falling into hell.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Wherefore to Him my feet shall run,
\par My eyes on His perfections gaze,
\par My soul shall live for God alone,
\par And all within me shout His praise.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

